menu "CSI gateway experiments"

config CSI_GATEWAY_ACK_MAX_AGE_MS
    int "Maximum age of receiver activity for immediate host ACK forwarding (ms)"
    range 1 50
    default 50
    help
        Experimental admission limit for immediate host acceptance ACKs. ACKs
        remain cached for a later receiver poll when forwarding is skipped.
        The default preserves the existing slot-length activity window.

endmenu
